  "_twist": {
    "sourceSystem": "zillow",
    "type": "instant-snap-dashed-focus",
    "intensity": 4,
    "description": "Instant snap punk: all transitions 0.05s steps(1) — no interpolation, states flip like a physical switch. Focus ring: 4px dashed outline (safety pin aesthetic). Ghost button hover inverts to black/white instantly. Accent button (DayGlo orange) inverts to black/orange on hover. Nothing eases — punk energy through radical immediacy."
  }
